---
description: VibeBoot Lite Starter conventions
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read AGENTS.md first; follow it.
- Edit copy/links in src/lib/site.ts; reuse primitives from src/components/ui.tsx.
- Tailwind v4 tokens only (text-neon, bg-ink). Black + #39FF14 brand. No purple.
- Server components by default. Run `npm run check` before declaring done.
